      title: Gregorian calendar
      authors: Wikipedia
      year: 2026
      finding: 'Introduced by Gregory XIII (Inter gravissimas, 1582): 4 October followed by 15 October; 97 leap years in 400; mean year 365.2425 days.'
      url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gregorian_calendar

